    <briefdescription>
<para>Parsed rate limit information from HTTP response headers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extracted from common rate limit headers:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RateLimit-Limit: total request limit</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RateLimit-Remaining: requests remaining in current window</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RateLimit-Reset: Unix timestamp when limit resets</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Retry-After: seconds to wait before retrying</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>X-RateLimit-* variants (GitHub, other APIs) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
